{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "VTBattle-VTubers aren't about the number of subscribers! It's about power!",
    "steam_appid": 3139930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Sunday, August 10, 2025, the popular Steam title <i>VTBattle: It\u2019s Not About Subscribers, It\u2019s About Strength!</i> has released its 8th card pack, <strong>&quot;OrgelDrop&quot;</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update adds 35 new VTubers, bringing the total to 270! Could there even be some hidden characters\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Highlights of the 8th Pack]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 new VTubers join the battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New status ailment: <strong>&quot;ATK-MAG Inversion&quot;</strong> \u2014 swaps ATK and MAG!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 brand-new skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased damage reduction rate for DEF and MDEF</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Favorite VTuber from Over 200 Characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 VTubers\u2014ranging from game streamers and singers to ASMR creators and illustrators\u2014have joined the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single one of them is fully playable as your main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/b407ff2529ecf91d5ddda422504569bb.avif?t=1754811622\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Robust Collection Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 100+ VTubers has unique cards of varying rarities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the cards of your favorite VTubers and complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Gameplay System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title combines elements of card games, auto-battles, and roguelites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will assemble a set of five cards, enhancing their stats such as HP, ATK, DEF, MAG, MDEF, and SPD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat rivals, obtain stronger cards, and face ever-tougher opponents in your journey to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/13cfd1bb47e44ab16b225c7ecd7adcd6.avif?t=1754811622\" data-has-big width=800 height=466 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Every Card Has a Role!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of a card depends not on its character but on its level and rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards of the same character can be leveled up, and higher rarities grant additional skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system ensures that every card can shine in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours to complete a run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game permits monetization during live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenue generation through video-sharing sites and live-streaming platforms is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may stream all scenes of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be freely featured in live streams as long as it is within standard usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please remember that this title features numerous VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kindly ask that you show respect to all featured performers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Sunday, August 10, 2025, the popular Steam title <i>VTBattle: It\u2019s Not About Subscribers, It\u2019s About Strength!</i> has released its 8th card pack, <strong>&quot;OrgelDrop&quot;</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update adds 35 new VTubers, bringing the total to 270! Could there even be some hidden characters\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Highlights of the 8th Pack]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 new VTubers join the battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New status ailment: <strong>&quot;ATK-MAG Inversion&quot;</strong> \u2014 swaps ATK and MAG!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 brand-new skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased damage reduction rate for DEF and MDEF</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Favorite VTuber from Over 200 Characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 VTubers\u2014ranging from game streamers and singers to ASMR creators and illustrators\u2014have joined the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single one of them is fully playable as your main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/b407ff2529ecf91d5ddda422504569bb.avif?t=1754811622\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Robust Collection Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 100+ VTubers has unique cards of varying rarities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the cards of your favorite VTubers and complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Gameplay System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title combines elements of card games, auto-battles, and roguelites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will assemble a set of five cards, enhancing their stats such as HP, ATK, DEF, MAG, MDEF, and SPD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat rivals, obtain stronger cards, and face ever-tougher opponents in your journey to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/13cfd1bb47e44ab16b225c7ecd7adcd6.avif?t=1754811622\" data-has-big width=800 height=466 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Every Card Has a Role!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of a card depends not on its character but on its level and rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards of the same character can be leveled up, and higher rarities grant additional skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system ensures that every card can shine in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours to complete a run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game permits monetization during live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenue generation through video-sharing sites and live-streaming platforms is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may stream all scenes of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be freely featured in live streams as long as it is within standard usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please remember that this title features numerous VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kindly ask that you show respect to all featured performers.</p>",
    "short_description": "VTuber Battle: It\u2019s Not About Subscribers! It\u2019s All About Power! is a card game combined with auto-battle mechanics! You can use over 100 VTubers as protagonists. Make your favorite VTuber the hero! Win battles, acquire even stronger cards, and aim to become the strongest!",
